# Copilot SDLC Adapter

This file is the VS Code Copilot adapter for the portable SDLC contract in
[docs/portable-agent-contract.md](../docs/portable-agent-contract.md). The
portable contract is authoritative for phases, state, permissions, gates,
task IDs, evidence, and escalation. Do not create a competing state machine or
weaker approval policy here.

